        "original_id": "589a1596-c1bf-522c-af2c-50e013f850a3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: U2\n- Events: U2 360° Tour, Lungs Tour\n- Places: Barcelona\n- Concepts: live performance, in-the-round staging, support act\n\nFacts:\n- The U2 360° Tour was a worldwide concert tour by U2.\n- The U2 360° Tour featured in-the-round concerts on a circular stage that allowed the audience to surround the band on all sides.\n- U2 did not perform \"Electrical Storm\" live until 2 July 2009, when they played it at the second Barcelona concert of the U2 360° Tour.\n- In 2011, acts from the Lungs Tour also supported U2 on the U2 360° Tour.",
